          "source_kind": "fulltext"
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "cluster_id": 5,
          "text": "Young adults aged 18 to 29 accounted for 59.5 percent, or 38.41 lakh, of the electors missing from Karnataka's final voter list.",
          "kind": "figure",
          "outlet": "The Hindu",
          "url": "https://www.thehindu.com/data/karnataka-sir-645-lakh-voters-potentially-missing-in-rolls-majority-of-them-young/article71638758.ece",
          "source_kind": "fulltext"
        },
        {
